--------------------------------------------------------------------------

pieces.json contains musical data (pitches, note durations, and score
excerpts) derived from MIDI files by Bernd Krueger, published at
http://www.piano-midi.de.

Per http://piano-midi.de/copy.htm, those MIDI files are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Germany License (CC BY-SA 3.0
DE):

    http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/de/deed.en

You may use and adapt this data as long as you:

  - attribute the copyright holder
      Name:   Bernd Krueger
      Source: http://www.piano-midi.de

  - distribute or publicly perform it (or any adaptation, including this
    file) only under the same (CC BY-SA 3.0 DE) license.
